          "reference_identifier": "2900",
          "uuid": "98b329d2-2af1-5a0c-b85e-43f90859eaef",
          "stig_uuid": "3817652a-d733-5ebb-b7dc-03a0b4466071",
          "status": "not_reviewed",
          "overrides": {},
          "comments": "Assessment recommendation: Likely covered\nEvidence state: source-inferred\nAssessed release: 2026.45.4-uds.1\nHorizon commit: b84b9afcd6983d553b6b8406317b6592ec90cb7c\n\nJustification: Auth store wipes local state and calls OIDC signout; LoggedOutView displays an explicit logout message. This supports the UI/logout mechanism without claiming old access tokens are immediately revoked.\n\nComponents: Delivered Horizon API, workers, chat, ingestion and storage; delegated UDS identity/gateway/mesh\n\nOwner: Gallatin engineering/SRE (Horizon and self-managed UDS Core on MPN)\n\nNext action: Maintain the cited source/configuration mapping for the selected release and reassess any Gallatin deployment overrides that change this control.\n\nEvidence:\n[logout] Browser logout\nCurrent auth store wipes local auth state then invokes OIDC signout. Local storage use alone is not proof that logout fails; replay/expiry/server-side invalidation need tests.\nhttps://github.com/gallatinai/horizon/blob/3f3b51d454197c077b33896caf93de72b94eafda/apps/web/src/auth/auth-store.ts\n\n[app-logged-out] app-logged-out\nDedicated logged-out view displays an explicit logout message and return-to-login action.\nhttps://github.com/gallatinai/horizon/blob/3f3b51d454197c077b33896caf93de72b94eafda/apps/web/src/views/LoggedOutView.vue",
