          ],
          "reference_identifier": "2900",
          "uuid": "c7f0b67d-c8f3-5fad-9d6f-0ac14f020c14",
          "stig_uuid": "3817652a-d733-5ebb-b7dc-03a0b4466071",
          "status": "not_reviewed",
          "overrides": {},
          "comments": "Assessment recommendation: Likely covered\nEvidence state: source-inferred\nAssessed release: 2026.45.4-uds.1\nHorizon commit: b84b9afcd6983d553b6b8406317b6592ec90cb7c\n\nJustification: Image-based releases replace old application software layers rather than overlaying arbitrary mutable libraries; the builder packages explicit image lists and verifies source digests. Persistent data cleanup is a separate concern.\n\nComponents: Delivered Horizon API, workers, chat, ingestion and storage; delegated UDS identity/gateway/mesh\n\nOwner: Gallatin engineering/SRE (Horizon and self-managed UDS Core on MPN)\n\nNext action: Maintain the cited source/configuration mapping for the selected release and reassess any Gallatin deployment overrides that change this control.\n\nEvidence:\n[images] Image release process\nBuilder verifies source digests and produces archive hashes; sample values with empty digests do not establish that a built release is unpinned. Assessed release/SBOM/scans still needed.\nhttps://github.com/gallatinai/horizon-uds-bundle/blob/d528b7febf1ce8bb5ccf99661dade6ae09a84381/scripts/build-bundle.py\n\n[app-web-image] app-web-image\nMultistage image copies only built Vue assets into the nginx runtime; source maps are removed. No application/OS user-management endpoint is implemented by the static nginx layer.\nhttps://github.com/gallatinai/horizon/blob/3f3b51d454197c077b33896caf93de72b94eafda/apps/web/Dockerfile",
          "finding_details": "Recommendation: Likely covered. Image-based releases replace old application software layers rather than overlaying arbitrary mutable libraries; the builder packages explicit image lists and verifies source digests. Persistent data cleanup is a separate concern.\n\nNext action: Maintain the cited source/configuration mapping for the selected release and reassess any Gallatin deployment overrides that change this control."
        },
        {
          "group_id_src": "V-204823",
          "group_tree": [
            {
